<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Tuesday's Gone"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Lynyrd Skynyrd"/><amll:meta key="album" value="(pronounced 'lĕh-'nérd 'skin-'nérd)"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="21052182"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM72304639"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USMC17347089"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="235518886"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="chan-air"/></metadata></head><body dur="06:08.843"><div begin="00:41.365" end="06:08.843"><p begin="00:41.365" end="00:48.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L0"><span begin="00:41.365" end="00:42.272">Train</span> <span begin="00:42.272" end="00:42.522">roll</span> <span begin="00:42.522" end="00:43.647">on,</span> <span begin="00:45.584" end="00:46.819">on</span> <span begin="00:46.819" end="00:47.502">down</span> <span begin="00:47.502" end="00:47.610">the</span> <span begin="00:47.610" end="00:48.840">line</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">列车就这样沿着铁轨不断前行</span></p><p begin="00:49.295" end="00:57.892" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:49.295" end="00:49.625">Won’t</span> <span begin="00:49.625" end="00:50.140">you</span> <span begin="00:51.332" end="00:51.727">please</span> <span begin="00:51.727" end="00:52.124">take</span> <span begin="00:52.124" end="00:52.337">me</span> <span begin="00:52.337" end="00:53.562">far</span> <span begin="00:54.747" end="00:54.962">a</span><span begin="00:54.962" end="00:57.892">way?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你愿意带着我一起飘向远方么？</span></p><p begin="01:00.783" end="01:08.579" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="01:00.783" end="01:00.923">Now</span> <span begin="01:00.923" end="01:01.088">I</span> <span begin="01:01.088" end="01:01.658">feel</span> <span begin="01:01.658" end="01:01.809">the</span> <span begin="01:01.809" end="01:02.186">wind</span> <span begin="01:02.186" end="01:03.676">blow</span> <span begin="01:05.266" end="01:06.509">out</span><span begin="01:06.509" end="01:06.976">side</span> <span begin="01:06.976" end="01:07.189">my</span> <span begin="01:07.189" end="01:08.579">door</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">此时此刻我听着门外凛冽的风声</span></p><p begin="01:10.858" end="01:18.371" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="01:10.858" end="01:10.858">Means</span> <span begin="01:10.858" end="01:11.083">I’m</span> <span begin="01:11.083" end="01:11.798">lea</span><span begin="01:11.798" end="01:11.939">ving</span> <span begin="01:11.939" end="01:12.330">my</span> <span begin="01:12.330" end="01:13.195">woman</span> <span begin="01:14.768" end="01:14.925">at</span> <span begin="01:14.925" end="01:18.371">home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">或许这意味着我将离开我心爱的姑娘</span></p><p begin="01:20.817" end="01:26.526" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="01:20.817" end="01:21.670">Tues</span><span begin="01:21.670" end="01:22.057">day’s</span> <span begin="01:22.057" end="01:23.947">gone</span> <span begin="01:23.947" end="01:24.312">with</span> <span begin="01:24.312" end="01:24.507">the</span> <span begin="01:24.507" end="01:26.526">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">星期二已渐行渐远</span></p><p begin="01:30.684" end="01:37.998" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="01:30.684" end="01:30.836">My</span> <span begin="01:30.836" end="01:31.379">babe</span> <span begin="01:31.379" end="01:31.683">is</span> <span begin="01:31.683" end="01:32.969">gone</span> <span begin="01:33.858" end="01:34.028">with</span> <span begin="01:34.028" end="01:34.216">the</span> <span begin="01:34.216" end="01:37.998">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的女孩也离我远去</span></p><p begin="01:59.820" end="02:07.728" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="01:59.820" end="02:00.005">And</span> <span begin="02:00.005" end="02:00.298">I</span> <span begin="02:00.298" end="02:01.070">don’t</span> <span begin="02:01.070" end="02:02.621">know</span> <span begin="02:05.398" end="02:05.845">where</span> <span begin="02:05.845" end="02:06.290">I’m</span> <span begin="02:06.290" end="02:06.658">go</span><span begin="02:06.658" end="02:07.728">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可是我依然糊涂万分不知路在何方</span></p><p begin="02:09.734" end="02:16.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="02:09.734" end="02:09.936">I</span> <span begin="02:09.936" end="02:10.313">just</span> <span begin="02:10.313" end="02:10.773">want</span> <span begin="02:10.773" end="02:10.956">to</span> <span begin="02:10.956" end="02:11.883">be</span> <span begin="02:12.843" end="02:13.116">left</span> <span begin="02:13.116" end="02:13.373">a</span><span begin="02:13.373" end="02:16.990">lone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有时候我只是想独自一人</span></p><p begin="02:19.302" end="02:27.252" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="02:19.302" end="02:19.490">Well,</span> <span begin="02:19.490" end="02:19.702">when</span> <span begin="02:19.702" end="02:20.052">this</span> <span begin="02:20.052" end="02:20.785">train</span> <span begin="02:20.785" end="02:22.315">ends</span> <span begin="02:23.991" end="02:25.042">I’ll</span> <span begin="02:25.042" end="02:25.662">try</span> <span begin="02:25.662" end="02:25.890">a</span><span begin="02:25.890" end="02:27.252">gain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">好吧，列车停止的那一刻我将再次前行</span></p><p begin="02:29.355" end="02:37.019" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="02:29.355" end="02:29.355">But</span> <span begin="02:29.355" end="02:29.567">I’m</span> <span begin="02:29.567" end="02:30.205">lea</span><span begin="02:30.205" end="02:30.372">ving</span> <span begin="02:30.372" end="02:30.654">my</span> <span begin="02:30.654" end="02:31.335">woman</span> <span begin="02:32.984" end="02:33.229">at</span> <span begin="02:33.229" end="02:37.019">home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">原谅我把心爱的女孩留在空荡的家里</span></p><p begin="02:39.253" end="02:45.458" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="02:39.253" end="02:40.040">Tues</span><span begin="02:40.040" end="02:40.485">day’s</span> <span begin="02:40.485" end="02:42.393">gone</span> <span begin="02:42.501" end="02:42.683">with</span> <span begin="02:42.683" end="02:42.878">the</span> <span begin="02:42.878" end="02:45.458">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">星期二已渐行渐远</span></p><p begin="02:48.743" end="02:55.211" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="02:48.743" end="02:49.616">Tues</span><span begin="02:49.616" end="02:50.049">day’s</span> <span begin="02:50.049" end="02:51.887">gone</span> <span begin="02:52.119" end="02:52.219">with</span> <span begin="02:52.219" end="02:52.414">the</span> <span begin="02:52.414" end="02:55.211">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">星期二已渐行渐远</span></p><p begin="02:58.257" end="03:04.372" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="02:58.257" end="02:59.124">Tues</span><span begin="02:59.124" end="02:59.557">day’s</span> <span begin="02:59.557" end="03:01.529">gone</span> <span begin="03:01.617" end="03:01.784">with</span> <span begin="03:01.784" end="03:01.967">the</span> <span begin="03:01.967" end="03:04.372">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">星期二已渐行渐远</span></p><p begin="03:07.815" end="03:14.156" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="03:07.815" end="03:08.109">My</span> <span begin="03:08.109" end="03:08.546">ba</span><span begin="03:08.546" end="03:08.961">be’s</span> <span begin="03:08.961" end="03:10.121">gone</span> <span begin="03:10.988" end="03:11.201">with</span> <span begin="03:11.201" end="03:11.381">the</span> <span begin="03:11.381" end="03:14.156">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="03:14.953" end="03:17.865"><span begin="03:14.953" end="03:15.668">(Train</span> <span begin="03:15.668" end="03:16.155">roll</span> <span begin="03:16.155" end="03:17.865">on)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">列车继续前行</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的女孩也离我远去</span></p><p begin="04:52.259" end="04:59.596" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="04:52.259" end="04:52.949">Train</span> <span begin="04:52.949" end="04:53.324">roll</span> <span begin="04:53.324" end="04:54.356">on</span> <span begin="04:56.671" end="04:56.924">ma</span><span begin="04:56.924" end="04:57.031">ny</span> <span begin="04:57.031" end="04:57.914">miles</span> <span begin="04:57.914" end="04:58.194">from</span> <span begin="04:58.194" end="04:58.669">my</span> <span begin="04:58.669" end="04:59.596">home</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这趟列车不知走了多远</span></p><p begin="05:01.687" end="05:08.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="05:01.687" end="05:01.687">See,</span> <span begin="05:01.687" end="05:01.872">I’m</span> <span begin="05:01.872" end="05:02.555">ri</span><span begin="05:02.555" end="05:02.700">ding</span> <span begin="05:02.700" end="05:03.020">my</span> <span begin="05:03.020" end="05:04.717">blues</span> <span begin="05:05.335" end="05:05.562">a</span><span begin="05:05.562" end="05:08.550">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你看啊，我带着我浅浅的惆怅慢慢前行</span></p><p begin="05:11.557" end="05:19.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="05:11.557" end="05:11.962">Tues</span><span begin="05:11.962" end="05:12.380">day,</span> <span begin="05:12.380" end="05:12.545">you</span> <span begin="05:12.545" end="05:13.560">see,</span> <span begin="05:15.990" end="05:16.210">she</span> <span begin="05:16.210" end="05:16.830">had</span> <span begin="05:16.830" end="05:17.042">to</span> <span begin="05:17.042" end="05:17.447">be</span> <span begin="05:17.447" end="05:19.350">free</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你知道么，在星期二，她终于自由了</span></p><p begin="05:21.093" end="05:28.523" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="05:21.093" end="05:21.285">But</span> <span begin="05:21.285" end="05:21.655">some</span><span begin="05:21.655" end="05:22.111">how</span> <span begin="05:22.111" end="05:22.503">I’ve</span> <span begin="05:22.503" end="05:22.876">got</span> <span begin="05:22.876" end="05:23.518">to</span> <span begin="05:24.536" end="05:24.731">car</span><span begin="05:24.731" end="05:24.931">ry</span> <span begin="05:24.931" end="05:28.523">on</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论如何，我却只能继续我的旅程</span></p><p begin="05:30.786" end="05:36.944" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="05:30.786" end="05:31.661">Tues</span><span begin="05:31.661" end="05:32.026">day’s</span> <span begin="05:32.026" end="05:33.986">gone</span> <span begin="05:34.029" end="05:34.239">with</span> <span begin="05:34.239" end="05:34.414">the</span> <span begin="05:34.414" end="05:36.944">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">星期二已渐行渐远</span></p><p begin="05:40.269" end="05:46.354" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="05:40.269" end="05:41.075">Tues</span><span begin="05:41.075" end="05:41.452">day’s</span> <span begin="05:41.452" end="05:43.247">gone</span> <span begin="05:43.442" end="05:43.597">with</span> <span begin="05:43.597" end="05:43.790">the</span> <span begin="05:43.790" end="05:46.354">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">星期二已渐行渐远</span></p><p begin="05:49.604" end="05:55.536" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="05:49.604" end="05:50.384">Tues</span><span begin="05:50.384" end="05:50.726">day’s</span> <span begin="05:50.726" end="05:52.714">gone</span> <span begin="05:52.770" end="05:52.982">with</span> <span begin="05:52.982" end="05:53.144">the</span> <span begin="05:53.144" end="05:55.536">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">星期二已渐行渐远</span></p><p begin="05:58.786" end="06:05.836" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="05:58.786" end="05:58.996">My</span> <span begin="05:58.996" end="05:59.551">ba</span><span begin="05:59.551" end="05:59.936">be’s</span> <span begin="05:59.936" end="06:00.941">gone</span> <span begin="06:01.946" end="06:02.066">with</span> <span begin="06:02.066" end="06:02.238">the</span> <span begin="06:02.238" end="06:05.836">wind</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="06:05.836" end="06:08.843"><span begin="06:05.836" end="06:06.501">(Train</span> <span begin="06:06.501" end="06:06.921">roll</span> <span begin="06:06.921" end="06:08.843">on)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">列车继续前行</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的女孩也离我远去</span></p></div></body></tt>